  "abstract": "This submission tests the hypothesis that a computationally simpler Mixture of Experts (MoE) model can outperform a more complex one by training for more epochs. It replaces the CNN-based experts from the SOTA model (ID 42) with simpler, faster MLP-based experts (based on ID 2). The goal is to determine if the benefits of longer convergence time outweigh the reduced architectural complexity of each expert, potentially leading to a better overall score.",
